WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.170
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:42.970
Alchemy

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:42.970
Shower

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.270
Thank you for showing everything

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.570
- I'm waiting for your decision
- Yes

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:55.660
This place is right between Jinyowon and Sosnovy Bor

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.620
Tiles and floors are good

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.290
This is the best option we've seen

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.250
Don't you think there are too many rooms?

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.090
They will have children soon

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.220
The son will take the surname Pak and head Sosnovy Bor

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.890
The daughter will take the surname Jin and lead Jinyeowon

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.350
They should give birth to more

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.930
It's good that I asked you to join me

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:22.810
I will choose the house that you like

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:28.730
To be honest,

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:33.570
I wouldn't like to live in a big house

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.080
I like a cozy house

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:41.410
where my husband and I will live happily

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.750
With a small garden where you can plant your favorite flowers

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.840
You love flowers so much

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.720
Maybe plant balsam?

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:58.970
My husband and I would paint our nails with paints from it*

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:58.970
*balsam root was crushed and used to color nails and fingertips yellow

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.690
It would be great to live like this

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.440
I'll look for you

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.280
such a house

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.450
What?

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:23.000
I will buy a house with a small garden

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.750
and I will plant balsam

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:29.170
This will be my gift

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:31.670
for your wedding

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.430
Gift?

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.310
Master Li loved Sapsari so much

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:45.560
I'll give you a puppy too

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:51.030
Are you marrying me to Master Li now?

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:52.090
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:56.240
You said you were happy just looking at him

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:57.090
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:02.090
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Mina_Mi

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:02.200
Do you think I was happy looking at Master Li?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:07.040
I'm not completely stupid

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.380
That is, you will generously give me a house,

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.840
what if I marry Master Li?

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:17.890
I have money for such a gift

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:20.010
Do you know

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.890
buy me a house with a hundred rooms

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.640
One hundred?

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.110
So you like big houses?

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.650
Still, I'm a little slow-witted

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.950
Are you a fool?

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.950
Feelings for you made me happy

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:52.880
I was hoping

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.090
you will understand sooner or later

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:00.550
Cooked your favorite dishes, sewed your clothes

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.140
Although you are slow, I hoped that one day

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.600
it will come to you

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.940
Are you passing me off as someone else?

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.730
Are you giving me a house for my wedding to someone else?

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.240
Maid Kim...

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:21.570
I didn't understand...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.660
Shut up!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.370
Choosing a house together

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.250
I imagined how we would get married,

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.170
how we will paint each other's nails in love

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.630
balsam flowers,

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:40.090
who picked in the garden

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.600
In love?

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.600
Yes! In love!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:48.640
Love is a carrot!

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.730
In love!

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.270
Yes! Exactly! In love!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.450
This picture is so vivid before my eyes

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.610
Forget it

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:03.200
You shattered my dreams

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.990
I won't expect anything more from you

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:10.080
But I will accept a house with a hundred rooms!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.750
I...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.750
Maid Kim!

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.800
Maid Kim

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:23.590
In love...

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:28.020
I ruined everything

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.560
Idiot

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.440
Excellent

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.490
I'll marry someone

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:41.740
Let him give me a home!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.910
There you are

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.370
Maid Kim, are you crying?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.370
No. Why should I cry?

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.420
Are you crying? Who upset?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.130
Your tears break my heart

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.760
I'm just jealous

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.930
that Mr. Dan Gu will get married before you

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.760
I'm jealous and sad

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.890
No need to be sad. I'm getting married soon

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.310
What?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:16.650
Have you finally decided to marry someone?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:20.690
Yes, so there is no reason for envy and sadness

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:21.900
Then...

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.360
Then you should leave it

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.990
What is this?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.200
Gifts for your wedding that I kept

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:33.210
I thought about giving them to Mr. Dan Gu and Ms. Cho Yeon

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.500
Why give it to them? A waste

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.580
Yes?

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:39.090
Should I give them to Mrs. Huo?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.260
Why does she need it?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.220
You said you were getting married

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.880
I know everything

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.970
She is your egg

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.600
- My egg?
- Your secret lover

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:57.690
Egg of a graceful heron on a treetop

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.280
Maid Kim, you misunderstood. This is not the same bird

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.900
- Isn't that her?
- No

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:10.030
I thought she would hatch from an egg

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.250
There is someone else, then?

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.540
Yes. Yes

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.040
And who is it?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.380
Maid Kim, don't be surprised

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.880
And if you can't restrain yourself,

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.550
bite your handkerchief

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.680
Who could it be?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.060
There were no other girls near you

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.280
Really...

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.030
Yes. Moo Deok will get it all

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:54.910
It can't be

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:58.580
How is that? What about Mrs. Ho?

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:04.960
I see things are going well between you and Mr. Chan Wook.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:05.960
Yes

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.340
I decided to marry him

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:10.760
I like to spread all sorts of rumors

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.930
Please. Let everyone know that I changed my destiny

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:18.890
The news of your wedding will clear up all the obscene rumors

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.730
"Indecent rumors"?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.820
Many people gossiped that he was impotent,

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.230
times chastity practices

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.150
This is not true

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.660
That's what everyone said. This is wrong?

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.280
Not a word of truth!

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.910
So you checked it yourself

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.120
What are you talking about?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.960
It's clear. And that's why I decided to marry him

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.290
What kind of woman would marry an impotent man?

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.250
even if he is a rich heir?

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.670
Don't worry

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:48.630
Rest assured, I'll tell everyone

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.630
"She checked, he is not impotent"

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.340
We haven't slept together yet!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.260
We really haven't had anything yet

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.560
Don't be shy. I'm older

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.650
You were so mean when we first met

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.480
And now there, a heart has appeared

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:13.490
I thought that one day you would break off relations with everyone and disappear

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:18.540
I told you I changed fate

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:23.290
I will stay and protect those I love

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.040
Apparently you like him a lot

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:32.630
I wish you to live happily

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:44.190
I will pick up a sword that will help you destroy Chan Wook

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:49.780
Only I can protect you by saving you from the King's star

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.950
Chan Wook lost all his strength

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:55.780
Gave all my energy to destroy the barrier

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:00.200
He can't become the next Gwangju

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.160
He lost his influence

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.750
And everyone thinks that the King's star has shone for me

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:12.670
You have nothing to offer me, Deputy Gwangju

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.850
Chang Gan sacrificed himself in the name of

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.970
Pine Forest, Jinyeowon and Jeonbugwan

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:23.770
But Jin Woo Tak is alive, you will be found guilty

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.310
I don't want to punish my former teacher

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:31.230
Make it clear and accept the punishment

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.820
Do you really think the stone has disappeared?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.250
Ice stone is filled with heavenly energy

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.790
Born under the star of the King

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.580
endowed with this power

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.670
What will you do

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.340
if Chang Wook is hiding this power?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.850
I'll be waiting for your answer

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:07.600
I will always be faithful to you, Your Highness

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:31.800
You came to your senses, but you continue to remain silent?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:39.010
I saved you only so that you could atone for your sins

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.760
in front of our daughter

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.640
Before Boo Young

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.020
When we first met

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.530
I fell in love with your warm smile

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.120
That's cute too

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:04.120
I think this will suit our Boo Young

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:10.170
And from the moment we met,

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.500
in love with you

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.920
I didn't love anyone

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.380
except

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.810
I'm trying to make things clear to you

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:32.190
I say this so that you suffer

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:37.940
I want you to know

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:42.160
deceived Jin Mu, you did this to our daughter

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:45.580
I hope you suffer

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.060
Jin Woo Tak in Saejukwon

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.770
He came to his senses

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.400
Since he's alive,

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.360
he will probably betray me and our organization

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.070
We need to get rid of him

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.120
I brought the ashes of the queen's souls

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.170
and bells, as you ordered

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:35.060
I can make all the nomads go crazy

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:39.440
If Chang Wook has the power of an ice stone,

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.740
he will have to show them

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:51.580
Make them two rings

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.120
You ordered two rings

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.210
So the rumors don't lie

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.050
These are rings for a wedding, do everything well

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.050
Of course

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.510
I'll do everything in the best possible way

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:08.550
Take a look at these options

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.890
Which one do you like?

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.640
These are beautiful

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.680
No!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.390
This...

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:18.480
It belonged to Mrs. Young Ok

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.520
- Oh, no, not these
- Okay

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.980
They're not very

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.200
- And this?
- No...

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.400
Well...

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.740
- Madam Seo Jong...
- Not the same either

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.080
I don't like anything

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.870
I will remove those that do not suit you

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.250
These...

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.540
And these

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.840
Here

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.420
Choose from the rest

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:48.010
Seven rings?

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.320
Wait

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:07.110
It didn't seem like it was seven. I really don't remember anyone

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.110
Were they like Cho Young?

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.080
Promised to marry if the gates of energy were opened?

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.950
I swear I didn't look after them first

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.620
You yourself said that you need to make an effort not to fall in love with a handsome man.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:20.170
They didn't try hard enough

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.880
Don't make me angry

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.210
Now I'm all yours

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.800
Aren't you proud that

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.800
went around everyone and got my heart?

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:32.640
If there were a dozen of them, I would be proud

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.310
Well, it's just funny

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.970
Do you think there weren't that many of them?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.980
I'm kidding. You're the only one

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.440
I forgot everyone

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:42.730
Wait a minute

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.780
I saw several rings when I was cleaning your room

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:47.570
We need to find them

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.910
Why look for rings that no one needs?

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.530
I'm sure there were about a dozen of them.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:55.580
Need to check

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.080
I don't have anyone

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.840
Moo Deok, let's eat

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.180
Tell me honestly

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.340
How many rings?

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.190
One

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.980
I will hold your hand in the ring of my arms

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.360
No one has a ring like this

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:29.110
Well...

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:32.070
Since we already have rings,

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.070
there is no need to make them from jade either

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.950
Maybe make some necklaces?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.580
As you wish

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.330
I don't envy Dan Gu one bit

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.130
- I don’t envy Cho Young one bit
- So the rumors are true

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.800
This mischievous gentleman... smiles

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.340
You're right

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.600
Apparently I was from the very beginning

00:17:56.890 --> 00:18:00.230
I misunderstood everything. Such a shame

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.520
Madam,

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:07.020
just don’t say that you confessed your feelings to him in that barrier

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:10.400
I was going to. I almost confessed

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.200
I had a chance

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.750
You don't have to hold a candle next to me

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.630
You can put it somewhere

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:31.010
Are you embarrassed that I'm here?

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.550
I'm happy with everything

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.760
Well, as you know

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.230
When you were lying in a drunken stupor in Sejukwon,

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:45.440
my advances didn't bother you

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.400
I thought you were Moo Deok

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.120
This is how he is next to his beloved

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.500
If Mr. Uk had suffered instead of Mr. Yulya,

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.130
you would get closer

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.920
You treat the wounded

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.630
Do you think so?

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.680
If he had been wounded,

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.270
Would I have a chance?

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.980
Seo Yul, I heard you are returning to Soho Fortress

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.360
Yes, after Dan Gu's wedding

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.070
Shall we have a party before you leave?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.200
Yes

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:52.880
Your wound has healed but you are still in pain?

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:57.050
I thought it would get better, but I was wrong

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.010
Something else happened while I was unconscious

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.640
lay in the barrier?

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.850
We stopped the bleeding

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:11.610
Escaped So Yi gave you her blood

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.780
You can't donate blood like that

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.450
Why such recklessness?

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.330
I just

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:25.200
wanted to save him

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.750
Her blood got into your wound

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.840
But this shouldn't cause any problems

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:36.340
I think I'll get better soon

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:40.010
Don't want the heads to worry so keep it a secret

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.760
Okay, to the bottom!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.560
Hey, what are you doing there?

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.850
What did you steal?

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:54.520
What is this?

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.480
Hey! Stop!

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:19.760
The wound left by the worm heals very slowly

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:34.020
That worm in his body

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:39.900
He's probably in pain

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.240
He needs the medicine I took in Jinyeowon

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.620
Moo Deok

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.840
You shouldn't work here anymore

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:01.510
What? Are you kicking me out?

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.630
If so, would you listen to me?

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:06.300
- No
- I knew it wasn't

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:07.890
Don't make me a bad person

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.480
Don't do housework anymore

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.980
You will be his beloved wife, I can't force you to work

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:21.190
So you accept me?

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:24.070
Do I have a choice? He just adores you

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:29.490
I won't call you mistress

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:32.330
I won't consider you my mother-in-law either.

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.250
Why should I be your mother-in-law if I myself am not yet married?

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.330
It would hurt my pride

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:38.090
Indeed

00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:41.460
But you and the head will get married soon, right?

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:45.890
I thought you liked each other

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:55.940
Maid Kim...

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:59.320
Even you noticed it, but he didn’t

00:22:59.860 --> 00:23:01.650
- Well...
- That is...

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:04.280
How can he be so slow-witted?

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:05.490
Is he close-minded or what?

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:06.950
He's just a fool

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:16.170
Yes! In love! Love is a carrot!

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:18.750
I can't

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.090
forget the words

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:23.460
which she said

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:26.180
me

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:38.060
Chapter

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:44.190
Uk...

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:47.410
When did you arrive?

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:49.820
Recently. I wanted to tell you something

00:23:49.910 --> 00:23:53.040
Why are you so worried?

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.330
Something terrible

00:23:56.710 --> 00:23:58.000
worries me

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:01.040
What did you want to say?

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:02.880
You see...

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:07.130
I plan to leave the capital for a while after Dan Gu's wedding.

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:09.340
How's that?

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:12.560
Then...

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:15.310
And the maid Kim?

00:24:17.480 --> 00:24:21.480
If no one wants her to stay, I'll have to take her with me.

00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:26.190
I don't know when we'll be back. Maybe in a year, or maybe in ten

00:24:26.280 --> 00:24:28.860
Or maybe we will never return

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:36.250
I did something

00:24:36.910 --> 00:24:39.580
unforgivable

00:24:42.920 --> 00:24:44.380
If I keep her here

00:24:44.460 --> 00:24:47.720
Do you think she will stay?

00:24:49.180 --> 00:24:50.050
She...

00:24:52.010 --> 00:24:52.970
cried

00:25:00.900 --> 00:25:04.110
She will cry harder if you don't stop her

00:25:10.320 --> 00:25:12.660
I'll leave

00:25:14.030 --> 00:25:15.240
with the young master

00:25:16.740 --> 00:25:17.950
I won't leave

00:25:20.160 --> 00:25:21.250
I'll leave

00:25:25.880 --> 00:25:28.840
There's no point in staying. Need to go

00:25:43.650 --> 00:25:46.520
I want something

00:25:48.280 --> 00:25:50.190
show you

00:26:01.160 --> 00:26:03.170
These are balsam seeds

00:26:04.500 --> 00:26:06.130
If you plant them right now,

00:26:07.040 --> 00:26:10.090
the flowers will bloom in three to four months

00:26:12.510 --> 00:26:16.010
I can make them bloom right now before your eyes,

00:26:16.100 --> 00:26:18.010
using a spell

00:26:19.180 --> 00:26:20.350
But...

00:26:22.520 --> 00:26:23.810
I'm very slow

00:26:29.230 --> 00:26:32.070
I want to slowly watch them sprout

00:26:33.900 --> 00:26:35.450
and bloom

00:26:41.790 --> 00:26:43.330
Will you wait for them to bloom with me?

00:27:16.700 --> 00:27:17.780
Of course

00:27:23.660 --> 00:27:24.660
I...

00:27:25.790 --> 00:27:29.210
I will go through life with you slowly

00:27:47.140 --> 00:27:50.650
This gift will only hinder them

00:28:11.090 --> 00:28:13.880
Thank you. We'll eat everything

00:28:13.960 --> 00:28:15.050
Thank you

00:28:26.430 --> 00:28:27.940
Have you seen it?

00:28:28.020 --> 00:28:30.650
This ahjusshi was crying

00:28:30.730 --> 00:28:35.070
I've never seen adults cry with snot

00:28:36.190 --> 00:28:38.530
He's probably sick

00:28:38.610 --> 00:28:39.780
Do you think so?

00:29:07.270 --> 00:29:08.480
Are you okay?

00:29:09.640 --> 00:29:11.310
I brought you some medicine

00:29:11.400 --> 00:29:12.730
Here

00:29:19.950 --> 00:29:23.280
As soon as the shaman Choi's brother speaks,

00:29:23.370 --> 00:29:25.160
we can catch Jin Mu

00:29:25.240 --> 00:29:28.250
I need to ask Jin Moo something

00:29:30.160 --> 00:29:32.750
My father himself decided to become a nomad

00:29:32.830 --> 00:29:35.710
or was there some story behind it?

00:29:35.790 --> 00:29:37.250
Only he knows

00:29:39.420 --> 00:29:42.970
Stargazer Cho Chun died because of Chang Gang's Gwangju

00:29:43.550 --> 00:29:47.430
Stargazer Cho learned that Gwangju used witchcraft

00:29:47.510 --> 00:29:49.230
For fear that everything will be revealed,

00:29:49.310 --> 00:29:52.520
Jin Mu made him a nomad and he went wild

00:29:52.600 --> 00:29:54.230
This means

00:29:54.310 --> 00:29:56.940
that we killed an innocent person?

00:30:03.410 --> 00:30:04.700
It's not our fault

00:30:05.320 --> 00:30:07.160
We didn't know the whole story

00:30:08.120 --> 00:30:09.330
Everyone thinks

00:30:09.410 --> 00:30:12.710
that astrologer Cho killed his family because he became interested in witchcraft

00:30:13.540 --> 00:30:17.210
Gwangju asked to clear Cho Chun's name

00:30:17.920 --> 00:30:21.800
We will discuss this at the next Unified Council

00:30:21.880 --> 00:30:25.050
But why did Jin Mu go so far?

00:30:25.140 --> 00:30:27.300
If he wanted to keep Cho Chun silent,

00:30:27.390 --> 00:30:28.850
why did he turn it

00:30:28.930 --> 00:30:32.640
into a soul swallower and forced to kill the whole family?

00:30:34.940 --> 00:30:36.110
Jin Mu knew everything

00:30:36.690 --> 00:30:40.230
about the circumstances of Chan Wook's birth

00:30:41.490 --> 00:30:42.990
He did it

00:30:43.070 --> 00:30:44.990
with Chang Gan's friend, Cho Chun,

00:30:46.370 --> 00:30:48.450
just to torment Chang Gang

00:30:48.530 --> 00:30:49.740
This means

00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:54.500
that if Jin Moo is caught, he will give up

00:30:55.830 --> 00:30:57.080
Mr Chan's secret

00:30:57.170 --> 00:31:00.800
We can't allow this to happen. Jin Mu

00:31:02.840 --> 00:31:04.590
must die

00:31:18.770 --> 00:31:22.440
If you place a curse on soul reflectors, then

00:31:22.530 --> 00:31:26.570
you can control the soul that uses it

00:31:38.540 --> 00:31:40.960
You can make him go wild

00:31:41.800 --> 00:31:46.180
and then get rid of it when it petrifies

00:31:55.310 --> 00:31:57.100
Shaman Choi

00:31:57.810 --> 00:32:02.270
placed a curse on all the soul reflectors she created

00:32:03.030 --> 00:32:07.110
That's why I haven't become a nomad to this day

00:32:08.820 --> 00:32:10.620
I'll force all the nomads

00:32:10.700 --> 00:32:14.450
in this capital to run wild, just like Cho Chun did that day

00:32:20.170 --> 00:32:21.090
Deputy,

00:32:22.170 --> 00:32:24.340
Chan Wook is about to leave Jeongjingak

00:32:26.050 --> 00:32:28.090
Will Pine Forest let him go?

00:32:28.180 --> 00:32:29.130
These are the rumors

00:32:29.220 --> 00:32:31.390
They say he is leaving the capital

00:32:31.470 --> 00:32:33.810
Will he leave everything?

00:32:33.890 --> 00:32:37.140
Chan Wook is my only weapon against the prince. If he leaves...

00:32:37.230 --> 00:32:39.270
There's nothing you can offer me

00:32:40.400 --> 00:32:41.360
deputy gwangju

00:32:42.310 --> 00:32:44.650
Why does he leave Sosnovy Bor?

00:32:44.730 --> 00:32:48.110
He drank poison to get there, took possession of Chisu

00:32:48.200 --> 00:32:51.160
Maybe he even has the power of the stone,

00:32:51.240 --> 00:32:52.700
so why?

00:32:57.330 --> 00:33:00.080
Maybe he has changed?

00:33:05.130 --> 00:33:07.550
This means he has changed

00:33:07.630 --> 00:33:09.930
Why did he change so suddenly?

00:33:11.930 --> 00:33:13.850
What made him change?

00:33:14.600 --> 00:33:17.980
People change because of other people

00:33:19.480 --> 00:33:22.150
Find out who appeared just at the moment when he began to change

00:33:25.150 --> 00:33:26.570
This will be the answer

00:33:27.360 --> 00:33:30.570
Find out who appeared just at the moment when he began to change

00:33:31.240 --> 00:33:32.910
I came for Nak Soo's sword

00:33:35.870 --> 00:33:39.160
It can't be. It couldn't be Nak Soo

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:42.880
He used Tansu, which was owned by Nak Su

00:33:43.460 --> 00:33:44.590
No...

00:33:45.790 --> 00:33:47.880
He probably learned this from Master Li

00:33:47.960 --> 00:33:51.010
I saw everything while I was with him in Danhyangok

00:33:51.090 --> 00:33:54.720
and there was no one with him except his maid

00:34:02.600 --> 00:34:07.690
Is he leaving with his maid?

00:34:07.770 --> 00:34:08.780
Yes

00:34:08.860 --> 00:34:12.780
He takes Moo Deok with him, who follows him everywhere.

00:34:28.920 --> 00:34:30.920
Sorry for bringing you here

00:34:31.550 --> 00:34:33.840
You said that you need to buy a lot of things

00:34:33.930 --> 00:34:35.510
I'll help

00:34:41.640 --> 00:34:43.520
If she is who I think she is...

00:35:32.440 --> 00:35:33.690
Moo Deok?

00:35:44.370 --> 00:35:46.960
-Are you okay?
- Yes

00:35:47.620 --> 00:35:49.540
Didn't you hear me calling you?

00:35:51.920 --> 00:35:52.920
I heard

00:35:53.710 --> 00:35:56.300
Why didn't I answer?

00:35:57.760 --> 00:35:59.720
Did you also hear the ringing of bells?

00:36:00.640 --> 00:36:02.930
Bells? I haven't heard

00:36:03.520 --> 00:36:06.810
- They're not very good, let's go
- Okay

00:36:10.150 --> 00:36:11.060
Nak Su,

00:36:12.820 --> 00:36:15.610
you gave me hope

00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:26.410
Master Li, there's one over there

00:36:27.080 --> 00:36:28.870
Eh, what are you doing?

00:36:29.540 --> 00:36:30.420
What's wrong with you?

00:36:30.500 --> 00:36:33.710
Master Li, you've missed so many fish

00:36:34.340 --> 00:36:36.590
I don't regret the fish I didn't catch

00:36:36.670 --> 00:36:38.340
What does this mean?

00:36:38.430 --> 00:36:41.140
Then it's a waste of time

00:36:42.140 --> 00:36:43.930
Otherwise it's greed and obsession

00:36:44.010 --> 00:36:46.310
- What?
- However,

00:36:46.390 --> 00:36:50.770
I realized that in loss there is pure sadness.

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:58.070
Lately I'm starting to understand why people are sad

00:36:58.150 --> 00:36:59.860
when they see the flow of water,

00:36:59.950 --> 00:37:04.080
the passing season and the setting sun

00:37:14.000 --> 00:37:16.550
Looking at this empty cart makes me sad

00:37:16.630 --> 00:37:18.720
Moo Deok said to catch a lot of fish

00:37:19.300 --> 00:37:21.680
So will you leave the nomad by your side?

00:37:25.680 --> 00:37:28.100
We kept our promise to you

00:37:28.850 --> 00:37:30.690
Nak Soo pointed her sword at me,

00:37:30.770 --> 00:37:32.730
and then dropped it

00:37:32.810 --> 00:37:38.110
So I hope you keep your end of the deal and let us go

00:37:38.190 --> 00:37:40.360
What happened to the ice stone that day?

00:37:41.450 --> 00:37:44.990
Could it be inside you?

00:37:59.630 --> 00:38:01.760
Even so,

00:38:02.800 --> 00:38:04.850
he is absolutely useless

00:38:04.930 --> 00:38:09.310
I can't even control a drop of water, let alone a Goldfish

00:38:11.890 --> 00:38:15.980
If you start training again, you will be able to use this power

00:38:16.570 --> 00:38:18.610
I saw how the desire to master this power

00:38:18.690 --> 00:38:21.950
made people cruel and evil

00:38:22.860 --> 00:38:26.030
It's better not to awaken the power of the ice stone

00:38:28.080 --> 00:38:31.160
You're greedy for fish

00:38:31.250 --> 00:38:33.250
don't you care about the ice stone?

00:38:34.540 --> 00:38:36.170
You're better than me

00:38:39.420 --> 00:38:42.880
Anyway, as long as I have the ice stone,

00:38:44.010 --> 00:38:46.180
I can protect one person

00:38:47.260 --> 00:38:50.520
If Moo Deok goes wild,

00:38:50.600 --> 00:38:54.060
help me use this power to stop this

00:38:54.140 --> 00:38:58.650
She'll be fine as long as she doesn't try to show her power.

00:38:59.230 --> 00:39:02.860
This weak body hides the powerful soul of a killer

00:39:02.940 --> 00:39:05.660
If anything had happened, she would have gone wild by now.

00:39:05.740 --> 00:39:07.530
She didn't go wild because

00:39:07.620 --> 00:39:10.990
that her body is controlled by the power of her soul

00:39:12.620 --> 00:39:15.210
I realized this when we first met

00:39:20.590 --> 00:39:23.130
The only thing comparable to the power of a magician is

00:39:23.220 --> 00:39:25.340
these are the divine powers of the priestesses

00:39:26.890 --> 00:39:30.260
I think Moo Deok's body originally belonged to

00:39:30.850 --> 00:39:33.310
someone with divine powers

00:39:57.290 --> 00:39:59.290
This will help relieve the pain

00:40:00.460 --> 00:40:04.090
It will only make it easier, but will not get rid of it.

00:40:05.380 --> 00:40:07.430
I have to give it to him

00:40:14.720 --> 00:40:17.560
You dug your own grave

00:40:19.900 --> 00:40:22.520
Dared to deceive me, pretending to be my daughter,

00:40:23.190 --> 00:40:24.070
So Yi?

00:40:26.780 --> 00:40:28.610
You weren't deceived

00:40:28.700 --> 00:40:31.450
You knew but you pretended

00:40:32.990 --> 00:40:34.700
Is it because of the ice stone?

00:40:36.410 --> 00:40:37.620
Yes

00:40:37.710 --> 00:40:40.830
A mother always recognizes her child

00:40:42.500 --> 00:40:44.050
Until you loose your tongue,

00:40:44.130 --> 00:40:48.300
better to kill you here and now

00:40:49.800 --> 00:40:51.180
So you and this

00:40:52.680 --> 00:40:54.010
do you recognize?

00:40:54.850 --> 00:40:57.020
Boo Young was wearing this headband when she went missing.

00:40:58.520 --> 00:41:00.440
You said you embroidered it yourself

00:41:11.910 --> 00:41:14.530
Where did you get this?

00:41:14.620 --> 00:41:16.830
Did Jin Mu give this to you?

00:41:19.160 --> 00:41:20.080
No

00:41:21.080 --> 00:41:24.750
Only I know who its real owner is

00:41:24.840 --> 00:41:26.050
Tell me

00:41:27.550 --> 00:41:29.380
Your daughter is still alive

00:41:31.010 --> 00:41:32.390
Kill me

00:41:33.090 --> 00:41:34.890
and you will never see her again

00:41:37.470 --> 00:41:38.600
I'll keep you alive

00:41:39.180 --> 00:41:41.020
Where is my daughter?

00:41:45.230 --> 00:41:46.480
Don't rush me

00:41:48.530 --> 00:41:52.240
I'll tell you when I'm sure I'm safe

00:42:09.300 --> 00:42:10.920
The ice stone has disappeared

00:42:11.420 --> 00:42:14.090
But there remained nomads, who were created by brother and sister Choi

00:42:14.180 --> 00:42:16.350
and their organization

00:42:17.060 --> 00:42:20.730
Sosnovy Bor and Jinyeowon will destroy them all

00:42:21.730 --> 00:42:24.560
I'm asking for your help

00:42:28.230 --> 00:42:29.990
You ask me

00:42:30.610 --> 00:42:33.030
didn't protect Jin Mu even if he gets caught?

00:42:33.110 --> 00:42:37.700
I know he was your teacher, but I believe that you are not blinded by him

00:42:40.160 --> 00:42:41.500
So do you trust me?

00:42:42.790 --> 00:42:44.000
Then you believe

00:42:44.960 --> 00:42:47.920
that I was born under the star of the King and removed the barrier?

00:42:52.630 --> 00:42:56.340
The ice stone barrier was lifted and you were there

00:42:56.430 --> 00:42:58.220
Then the King's star shone

00:42:59.220 --> 00:43:03.020
'Cause like everyone else, I believe that a star has shone upon you

00:43:07.860 --> 00:43:10.650
I wasn't alone here that day

00:43:11.860 --> 00:43:13.240
You stood there

00:43:13.320 --> 00:43:17.160
Who would notice someone else besides you?

00:43:17.240 --> 00:43:21.450
Chan Wook was there, I'm sure you saw him

00:43:23.870 --> 00:43:25.790
He's like a son to me

00:43:26.920 --> 00:43:29.170
You saved his life, Your Majesty

00:43:30.170 --> 00:43:32.210
I'm truly grateful for this

00:43:42.930 --> 00:43:45.690
Today I am leaving Sosnovy Bor

00:43:45.770 --> 00:43:47.020
I leave my work here

00:43:49.310 --> 00:43:51.860
You went through so much to get this job.

00:43:52.610 --> 00:43:54.940
It's a shame you're leaving because of the wedding.

00:43:55.610 --> 00:43:59.240
On the other hand, you will become the lady of the Chang family

00:44:01.950 --> 00:44:04.040
Moo Deok, congratulations on your wedding

00:44:04.120 --> 00:44:05.210
Be happy

00:44:12.170 --> 00:44:14.590
Let's do it now. Let's go

00:44:15.260 --> 00:44:18.970
Why are you standing there? Follow me

00:44:22.810 --> 00:44:27.440
Your Highness, thank you for saving my life

00:44:28.190 --> 00:44:31.560
I hope the King's star will shine forever

00:44:31.650 --> 00:44:33.860
That's enough. No need to pretend

00:44:34.440 --> 00:44:35.360
Awkward

00:44:37.990 --> 00:44:41.320
You know it was Chan Wook who saved everyone that day

00:44:41.410 --> 00:44:45.620
As you two agreed, I won't tell a living soul.

00:44:45.700 --> 00:44:46.870
So don't worry

00:44:48.790 --> 00:44:52.130
Do you think I'm worried about losing fame?

00:44:52.210 --> 00:44:54.840
I'm just annoyed by everyone's flattery

00:44:54.920 --> 00:44:57.670
They all praise you

00:44:57.760 --> 00:45:01.010
You can just accept this praise

00:45:01.090 --> 00:45:03.890
It's unpleasant to hear flattery from strangers, but...

00:45:04.600 --> 00:45:06.810
When you thank me, knowing the whole truth,

00:45:08.430 --> 00:45:11.190
It seems like you're kidding me. Annoying

00:45:16.400 --> 00:45:18.490
I understand that you are uncomfortable

00:45:20.780 --> 00:45:23.450
You'll never see me again

00:45:23.950 --> 00:45:25.030
So don't worry

00:45:27.080 --> 00:45:28.160
I heard

00:45:29.540 --> 00:45:32.040
-You're leaving with him
- Yes

00:45:32.130 --> 00:45:35.460
We're going to move away from here and live together

00:45:36.050 --> 00:45:37.090
Together?

00:45:39.970 --> 00:45:42.010
I could easily stop you from leaving

00:45:42.760 --> 00:45:44.800
Do you think I'll let him go?

00:45:45.640 --> 00:45:47.270
when he knows my weakness?

00:45:50.060 --> 00:45:54.900
And if we stay close, how will you feel?

00:45:57.530 --> 00:46:00.950
It won't end with just irritation

00:46:07.290 --> 00:46:08.290
Yes

00:46:08.790 --> 00:46:11.710
Won Moo Deok, you listened to my petty complaints

00:46:12.750 --> 00:46:14.750
Listen to this too

00:46:15.590 --> 00:46:18.710
I'll feel worthless knowing that he did what I couldn't.

00:46:19.260 --> 00:46:22.760
And by pretending that it's all my fault, I'll become even more pathetic.

00:46:22.840 --> 00:46:23.890
But most of all

00:46:25.760 --> 00:46:27.850
I will fiercely despise...

00:46:29.850 --> 00:46:32.690
seeing both of you together

00:46:36.360 --> 00:46:37.520
I already said

00:46:37.610 --> 00:46:41.070
I don't hold on to what I can't hold on to

00:46:41.150 --> 00:46:43.910
Do you know what will happen if I try to hold someone and I can’t?

00:46:45.780 --> 00:46:47.870
You will blame this man

00:46:49.240 --> 00:46:50.870
and get rid of it?

00:46:50.950 --> 00:46:54.790
If self-pity turns into cruelty or anger,

00:46:57.590 --> 00:47:00.630
avoiding me won't fix anything

00:47:03.260 --> 00:47:05.390
Go so far that I

00:47:07.180 --> 00:47:08.470
couldn't get you

00:47:22.740 --> 00:47:23.900
Guys,

00:47:24.990 --> 00:47:26.450
I'm getting married tomorrow!

00:47:32.910 --> 00:47:34.040
You boys

00:47:34.620 --> 00:47:37.750
We won't see each other that often anymore

00:47:37.830 --> 00:47:38.750
Of course not

00:47:38.840 --> 00:47:41.880
Cho Young wouldn't let that happen

00:47:41.960 --> 00:47:43.760
- Neither his mother-in-law
- Exactly

00:47:44.920 --> 00:47:46.510
He won't come again

00:47:47.220 --> 00:47:48.850
ride horses

00:47:48.930 --> 00:47:50.970
Or go fishing with us

00:47:51.970 --> 00:47:55.060
I will find time to see you

00:47:55.140 --> 00:47:57.810
And how? Are you going to lie about training?

00:47:57.900 --> 00:48:00.690
Were you seriously planning to lie to the priestess of Jinyeowon?

00:48:00.770 --> 00:48:02.480
He will be caught immediately

00:48:02.570 --> 00:48:05.070
She will surround you with her relics

00:48:05.150 --> 00:48:06.610
and demand the truth

00:48:06.700 --> 00:48:08.450
Then you confess everything

00:48:09.030 --> 00:48:11.740
They'll pluck out all his hair

00:48:11.830 --> 00:48:13.950
Let's start with the fact that he has thin hair

00:48:19.580 --> 00:48:20.540
I understand

00:48:20.630 --> 00:48:21.790
Are you jealous of me

00:48:22.630 --> 00:48:24.880
I'm still happy

00:48:24.960 --> 00:48:27.720
I'm marrying my first love

00:48:28.340 --> 00:48:32.760
I give you, bachelors, my good energy

00:48:35.220 --> 00:48:38.270
- Caught
- Yes, you have Moo Deok

00:48:38.350 --> 00:48:40.400
- Yes
-But she's not your first love

00:48:40.480 --> 00:48:43.190
- Is she already the eighth?
- No... no... no

00:48:43.270 --> 00:48:45.650
- Just don't tell her that.
- Okay

00:48:45.740 --> 00:48:47.610
Okay, we'll leave you alone

00:48:47.700 --> 00:48:50.200
Yul, you can take my energy

00:48:50.280 --> 00:48:51.320
No need

00:48:52.370 --> 00:48:53.580
I was recently rejected

00:48:53.660 --> 00:48:54.830
What?

00:48:54.910 --> 00:48:56.160
Who?

00:48:57.620 --> 00:48:58.830
Moo Deok?

00:49:02.840 --> 00:49:03.960
No

00:49:04.500 --> 00:49:07.470
I didn't have feelings for her

00:49:11.760 --> 00:49:13.720
Then who is it?

00:49:14.600 --> 00:49:16.180
Uk, do you know?

00:49:16.810 --> 00:49:18.730
Well I have my guesses

00:49:23.690 --> 00:49:27.150
Have you decided where you're going yet, Chan Wook?

00:49:28.440 --> 00:49:31.360
Village of Sari. I want to know something

00:49:31.450 --> 00:49:34.870
Are you ready to return to Soho Fortress?

00:49:35.490 --> 00:49:37.620
You're leaving right after my wedding, right?

00:49:37.700 --> 00:49:39.160
A little later I think

00:49:40.000 --> 00:49:41.540
I haven't recovered yet

00:49:41.620 --> 00:49:43.250
Does it still hurt?

00:49:43.330 --> 00:49:45.170
I heard that the wound has already healed

00:49:45.750 --> 00:49:47.670
What? Is Master Huo a charlatan?

00:49:48.510 --> 00:49:50.050
The wound has healed

00:49:50.130 --> 00:49:51.590
but it still hurts me

00:49:53.140 --> 00:49:54.100
I'll be fine

00:50:08.690 --> 00:50:09.860
Mr. So Yul

00:50:11.280 --> 00:50:13.450
I don't know if I should give this to you

00:50:13.530 --> 00:50:16.870
But one beggar asked me to give

00:50:28.920 --> 00:50:33.180
This medicine will relieve chest pain

00:50:33.260 --> 00:50:34.930
You have to accept it

00:50:36.260 --> 00:50:38.390
This person knows about my condition

00:50:39.100 --> 00:50:40.220
Who is this?

00:50:51.490 --> 00:50:54.110
I knew you would return, Your Highness

00:50:55.910 --> 00:50:59.160
Chan Wook is exhausted, I'll send him away from here

00:50:59.240 --> 00:51:01.370
He doesn't have an ice stone

00:51:02.040 --> 00:51:04.870
Confess your crimes by the end of the day

00:51:04.960 --> 00:51:06.210
If you don't do this,

00:51:08.540 --> 00:51:10.920
I will catch you and punish you myself

00:51:13.800 --> 00:51:16.050
Everyone is deceiving you

00:51:19.010 --> 00:51:21.390
Have you seen the head of Sosnovy Bor today?

00:51:21.930 --> 00:51:23.600
What did he say?

00:51:23.680 --> 00:51:26.810
Were you delighted that a star was shining above you?

00:51:27.690 --> 00:51:31.360
He knows it was Chan Wook and not you

00:51:33.740 --> 00:51:35.990
So is Master Li.

00:51:36.070 --> 00:51:37.990
He broke into the palace

00:51:38.070 --> 00:51:40.330
and mentioned the King's star

00:51:43.370 --> 00:51:46.920
Are you saying that everyone is deceiving me and mocking me?

00:51:47.000 --> 00:51:49.420
They are trying to protect Chan Wook

00:51:50.000 --> 00:51:51.840
The stone belongs to the one for whom the star shines

00:51:51.920 --> 00:51:53.300
and Sosnovy Bor protects him

00:51:53.380 --> 00:51:56.430
Only I can protect you

00:52:01.390 --> 00:52:03.810
Chan Wook is keeping a big secret

00:52:04.390 --> 00:52:05.940
I'll expose him...

00:52:07.480 --> 00:52:08.560
and...

00:52:09.480 --> 00:52:13.230
I'll make you sink to the bottom

00:52:22.950 --> 00:52:24.040
That's it...

00:52:25.040 --> 00:52:27.460
Who drank it all?

00:52:27.540 --> 00:52:28.750
Your cup is empty

00:52:28.830 --> 00:52:30.920
Was it you? You drank it all

00:52:31.540 --> 00:52:33.130
If the cup is empty, pour me more

00:52:33.210 --> 00:52:34.630
- That's it
- Have a drink

00:52:34.710 --> 00:52:37.260
"Have a drink"? How dare you?

00:52:37.340 --> 00:52:38.720
- “Have a drink”?..
- To the bottom

00:52:40.470 --> 00:52:42.260
Oh, it's our young master!

00:52:42.350 --> 00:52:46.850
We celebrated something today

00:52:46.930 --> 00:52:49.560
- Her departure from Sosnovy Bor
- I see

00:52:49.650 --> 00:52:52.150
- Hello, Chan Wook
- Hey!

00:52:52.730 --> 00:52:54.530
He's your young master

00:52:55.400 --> 00:52:57.990
I'm sorry. My mistake

00:52:58.070 --> 00:53:00.200
- That's right
- They drank too much

00:53:00.280 --> 00:53:01.280
Young Master

00:53:01.370 --> 00:53:03.490
Come here

00:53:07.000 --> 00:53:10.000
I'll show you something amazing

00:53:10.080 --> 00:53:11.540
When Moo Deok is drunk

00:53:12.460 --> 00:53:14.710
she doesn't speak dialect

00:53:16.380 --> 00:53:17.970
Amazing, right?

00:53:18.550 --> 00:53:19.630
I can't

00:53:19.720 --> 00:53:22.300
show something really worthwhile

00:53:23.010 --> 00:53:25.930
But I can fly to the roof

00:53:26.020 --> 00:53:28.270
Really? Try it

00:53:28.350 --> 00:53:30.190
- Should I try?
- Try it

00:53:31.520 --> 00:53:32.480
Look closely

00:53:39.610 --> 00:53:41.780
Just a second

00:53:44.580 --> 00:53:45.990
- Moo Deok...
- Doesn't work

00:53:46.080 --> 00:53:47.040
Sit down

00:53:47.120 --> 00:53:49.540
Can't do it anymore

00:53:50.790 --> 00:53:52.710
And I can’t draw my sword

00:53:52.790 --> 00:53:54.460
What? This?

00:53:54.540 --> 00:53:57.130
It's not yours. This is Nak Soo's sword

00:53:57.960 --> 00:53:59.300
- Young Master
- Yes?

00:53:59.380 --> 00:54:03.640
Why did you bring this garbage again?

00:54:03.720 --> 00:54:05.550
I'll get rid of him

00:54:06.510 --> 00:54:08.220
Give me one more chance

00:54:08.310 --> 00:54:09.560
- Of course, try it
- Sit down

00:54:09.640 --> 00:54:11.600
Fly, do it

00:54:15.770 --> 00:54:18.190
- Clean up here and go to sleep
-Did you see this?

00:54:18.280 --> 00:54:20.030
- I'll deal with Moo Deok
- I can fly

00:54:20.110 --> 00:54:22.030
- Don't move
- It worked

00:54:22.110 --> 00:54:23.990
She really flew

00:54:25.120 --> 00:54:27.120
Chief, did you see this?

00:54:27.200 --> 00:54:28.950
I want to fly too

00:54:29.040 --> 00:54:32.000
You kids have no idea who I am

00:54:32.080 --> 00:54:35.130
I'm the master here. Do you want me to show you?

00:54:38.710 --> 00:54:39.840
I'm the master here

00:54:40.510 --> 00:54:42.170
Today is just not my day

00:54:49.350 --> 00:54:50.350
Moo Deok

00:54:50.430 --> 00:54:53.560
Never drink again. You will tell everyone that you are Nak Soo

00:54:56.360 --> 00:54:58.150
I have to tell you something

00:54:58.230 --> 00:54:59.900
Sleep, you'll tell me tomorrow

00:55:01.610 --> 00:55:02.950
Need it today

00:55:03.450 --> 00:55:06.320
What if I die tomorrow without telling you anything?

00:55:06.990 --> 00:55:09.370
Okay, speak up. Suddenly die

00:55:09.450 --> 00:55:10.540
I'm listening

00:55:15.210 --> 00:55:16.420
Chan Wook

00:55:19.460 --> 00:55:21.050
I like you very much

00:55:39.440 --> 00:55:41.730
Yeah, and went straight to bed

00:55:41.820 --> 00:55:43.190
Just like that

00:55:46.660 --> 00:55:49.700
We need to tell her what Master Li said

00:55:51.410 --> 00:55:54.500
I think Moo Deok's body originally belonged to

00:55:55.000 --> 00:55:57.330
someone with divine powers

00:55:58.710 --> 00:56:01.050
Maybe I'll find out when I get to the village of Sari

00:57:43.860 --> 00:57:46.980
Let bygones be bygones

00:57:47.070 --> 00:57:49.280
Now you will become relatives

00:57:50.610 --> 00:57:53.160
Cho Young does not join the Park family

00:57:53.740 --> 00:57:56.580
This is Dan Gu becoming part of our

00:57:57.450 --> 00:57:59.000
He's not moving in with you

00:57:59.750 --> 00:58:02.710
You say things like that and people gossip

00:58:02.790 --> 00:58:05.380
that Park Dan Gu will soon become Jin Dan Gu

00:58:07.090 --> 00:58:09.050
Their daughters will give our last name

00:58:09.720 --> 00:58:11.050
And our son - ours

00:58:12.090 --> 00:58:14.800
Don't argue on this wonderful day

00:58:14.890 --> 00:58:16.810
Guests will arrive soon

00:58:16.890 --> 00:58:19.730
Be ready to greet them

00:58:19.810 --> 00:58:21.520
Come on

00:58:24.730 --> 00:58:25.980
Where is Dan Gu?

00:58:26.070 --> 00:58:28.110
He will go to Saejukwon with Jo Young first

00:58:28.690 --> 00:58:31.400
They want to get to her father and say hello

00:58:32.570 --> 00:58:33.610
Where is Moo Deok?

00:58:35.370 --> 00:58:37.910
Don't know. She came first, but I didn't see her

00:58:39.500 --> 00:58:42.040
Is she embarrassed and avoiding me because of last night?

00:59:46.690 --> 00:59:47.600
Nak Su,

00:59:48.940 --> 00:59:51.820
you can't draw your sword because you're stuck in this body

00:59:53.030 --> 00:59:56.110
You are my last weapon

00:59:56.200 --> 00:59:59.200
I'll use all my strength to call yours

01:00:00.120 --> 01:00:01.950
As soon as you get your strength back,

01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:04.540
you're going wild

01:01:02.050 --> 01:01:05.060
Only I know who its real owner is

01:01:05.810 --> 01:01:08.190
Your daughter is still alive

01:01:09.140 --> 01:01:10.270
Mother

01:01:21.320 --> 01:01:22.370
Maid Kim

01:01:28.580 --> 01:01:31.750
Where did your maid Moo Deok used to live?

01:01:33.210 --> 01:01:36.050
Are her parents alive?

01:01:37.010 --> 01:01:40.260
No. She comes from the village of Sari

01:01:41.340 --> 01:01:43.890
When she was accused of So Yi's crimes,

01:01:43.970 --> 01:01:45.510
I told you everything

01:01:46.310 --> 01:01:48.100
I asked you to help this poor girl

01:01:48.850 --> 01:01:50.310
But you didn't help

01:01:51.600 --> 01:01:54.440
Does So Yi know Moo Deok?

01:01:55.070 --> 01:01:57.990
Yes. Ms. Cho Young knows her too

01:02:04.120 --> 01:02:05.870
You are incredibly beautiful

01:02:08.120 --> 01:02:10.960
I can say the same about you

01:02:14.380 --> 01:02:17.250
Let's say hello to your father

01:02:17.840 --> 01:02:19.590
You can't stay here for long

01:02:20.170 --> 01:02:23.300
If the elders find out, they will sit on their ears

01:02:23.930 --> 01:02:24.970
Yes

01:02:25.930 --> 01:02:27.010
Thank you

01:02:28.600 --> 01:02:31.100
mu... husband

01:02:36.520 --> 01:02:37.690
Be careful

01:02:39.650 --> 01:02:40.650
well... wife

01:02:41.740 --> 01:02:42.910
My wife

01:02:44.280 --> 01:02:45.620
Wait

01:02:51.040 --> 01:02:54.250
Moo Deok? Why are you here?

01:02:59.590 --> 01:03:02.170
Moo Deok, you can't bring the sword

01:03:05.590 --> 01:03:07.890
Kill Jin Woo Tak first

01:03:13.850 --> 01:03:14.810
Moo Dok!

01:03:45.840 --> 01:03:47.260
What's happening?

01:03:49.760 --> 01:03:50.890
You

01:03:51.560 --> 01:03:53.560
Chan Wook's maid?

01:03:54.140 --> 01:03:55.310
Are you okay?

01:04:21.340 --> 01:04:23.260
Kill Jin Woo Tak

01:04:30.890 --> 01:04:32.010
Father!

01:04:34.180 --> 01:04:36.270
Father!

01:04:38.560 --> 01:04:39.650
Moo Deok,

01:04:39.730 --> 01:04:40.810
what are you doing?

01:04:40.900 --> 01:04:42.400
She...

01:04:42.480 --> 01:04:45.190
She's a mercenary

01:04:45.940 --> 01:04:47.110
Run, Cho Young

01:04:47.200 --> 01:04:48.450
Hurry up!

01:05:13.390 --> 01:05:14.640
Mister!

01:05:14.720 --> 01:05:15.930
Stop Moo Deok

01:05:19.600 --> 01:05:20.440
Moo Deok

01:05:22.650 --> 01:05:24.520
Stop her!

01:05:25.860 --> 01:05:26.900
No...

01:05:55.930 --> 01:05:57.930
Kill her! Rather

01:06:15.490 --> 01:06:16.540
Father!

01:06:17.990 --> 01:06:20.040
Father!

01:06:20.580 --> 01:06:21.420
Father!

01:06:23.250 --> 01:06:24.080
Father

01:06:25.670 --> 01:06:27.710
Father

01:06:29.170 --> 01:06:30.550
Father

01:06:31.170 --> 01:06:32.760
Don't die

01:06:36.100 --> 01:06:37.850
Dad, please...

01:06:38.600 --> 01:06:40.140
Dad

01:06:43.150 --> 01:06:44.270
Dad

01:06:52.150 --> 01:06:55.990
Dad don't die

01:06:57.700 --> 01:06:58.790
Nak Su,

01:07:00.250 --> 01:07:02.660
kill those who did this to your father

01:07:08.040 --> 01:07:09.250
Dad!

01:07:10.090 --> 01:07:11.300
Dad!

01:07:11.380 --> 01:07:12.760
Dad!

01:07:13.510 --> 01:07:14.760
Dad!

01:07:44.920 --> 01:07:47.130
How dare you appear here?

01:07:48.380 --> 01:07:49.920
Catch Jin Mu!

01:07:51.510 --> 01:07:53.050
I, Deputy of Gwangju,

01:07:53.130 --> 01:07:55.010
came to catch the nomad

01:07:57.590 --> 01:08:00.930
Nak Su, nomad, now in Sosnovy Bor

01:08:02.060 --> 01:08:04.100
- Nak Soo?
- Head!

01:08:08.650 --> 01:08:10.110
Trouble!

01:08:10.190 --> 01:08:12.690
Mercenary appeared in Sejukwon

01:08:15.110 --> 01:08:18.280
She killed Mr. Jin

01:08:19.280 --> 01:08:22.160
This is the mercenary I'm looking for. Nak Soo

01:08:22.910 --> 01:08:23.790
No

01:08:24.620 --> 01:08:26.080
This...

01:08:26.160 --> 01:08:27.370
It was Moo Deok

01:08:27.460 --> 01:08:31.290
This Moo Deok is Nak Soo

01:08:38.640 --> 01:08:39.680
Mercenary!

01:08:40.350 --> 01:08:42.220
Mercenary in Saejukwon!

01:09:14.880 --> 01:09:16.300
Catch her!

01:09:38.320 --> 01:09:39.900
- Catch it!
- Eat!

01:11:20.170 --> 01:11:21.170
Moo Deok

01:11:25.010 --> 01:11:26.140
Moo Deok

01:11:29.390 --> 01:11:30.520
Moo Deok

01:11:35.100 --> 01:11:36.100
Moo Deok

01:11:42.030 --> 01:11:42.860
Chan Wook?

01:11:57.380 --> 01:11:58.710
It's me?

01:12:00.420 --> 01:12:01.670
It's me

01:12:03.920 --> 01:12:05.300
I pierced you

01:12:26.610 --> 01:12:27.740
One

01:12:30.200 --> 01:12:33.080
I will hold your hand in the ring of my arms

01:12:33.950 --> 01:12:36.540
No one has a ring like this

01:12:39.750 --> 01:12:42.050
If I become Nak Soo, I'll be in danger

01:12:42.630 --> 01:12:45.920
It shouldn't concern you what happens to me then

01:12:48.640 --> 01:12:49.550
Why?

01:12:50.050 --> 01:12:52.260
Because we will no longer be student and teacher?

01:12:52.350 --> 01:12:54.600
You'll have no reason to protect me

01:12:54.680 --> 01:12:56.980
And I have reasons to be gentler with you

01:12:58.190 --> 01:13:00.360
This was our promise

01:13:00.900 --> 01:13:02.690
Then promise me one more thing

01:13:02.770 --> 01:13:04.230
When you get your strength back,

01:13:04.940 --> 01:13:07.450
if you have to raise a sword on someone,

01:13:08.490 --> 01:13:10.200
let me be the first

01:13:11.450 --> 01:13:12.620
If you pierce me,

01:13:12.700 --> 01:13:17.460
I will die to the one who released the mercenary

01:13:24.090 --> 01:13:25.210
Chan Wook!

01:13:29.550 --> 01:13:30.760
Chan Wook!

01:13:34.850 --> 01:13:36.600
No...

01:14:36.660 --> 01:14:37.660
Catch her!

01:15:20.830 --> 01:15:21.870
Uk...

01:15:28.960 --> 01:15:30.420
Uk!

01:16:22.720 --> 01:16:24.020
I think

01:16:27.020 --> 01:16:30.310
Wook knew that Moo Deok was Nak Soo

01:16:32.030 --> 01:16:33.400
Jin Mu

01:16:34.440 --> 01:16:37.410
looking for evidence of this in Jeonjingak as we speak

01:16:42.950 --> 01:16:44.540
I knew it too

01:16:45.710 --> 01:16:47.540
Let me go after her

01:16:47.620 --> 01:16:50.210
and find out what happened

01:16:50.290 --> 01:16:53.300
You are the eldest son of the So family

01:16:54.300 --> 01:16:57.050
You didn't know anything

01:16:58.510 --> 01:17:01.510
From now on you are not allowed to leave this place.

01:17:13.520 --> 01:17:14.730
Father died

01:17:15.530 --> 01:17:18.200
at the hands of a mercenary

01:17:18.820 --> 01:17:20.110
I'll find

01:17:21.370 --> 01:17:23.330
and I'll kill her

01:17:26.200 --> 01:17:27.250
No

01:17:30.630 --> 01:17:34.800
You must find her and bring her back alive.

01:17:36.550 --> 01:17:40.090
Nak Soo is only a soul in this body

01:17:40.180 --> 01:17:43.300
I have to find out who this body belonged to.

01:17:45.810 --> 01:17:48.310
Bring her back at any cost

01:17:58.610 --> 01:18:01.240
Nak Su practiced soul alchemy

01:18:01.320 --> 01:18:03.570
along with the Choi family

01:18:04.370 --> 01:18:06.370
I've caught her before

01:18:06.450 --> 01:18:08.000
when he killed all her people

01:18:08.080 --> 01:18:10.750
That's why I knew that Nak Soo was still alive

01:18:11.370 --> 01:18:13.960
I've been looking for her all this time

01:18:14.040 --> 01:18:15.630
to clear your name

01:18:15.710 --> 01:18:16.880
And she's a daughter

01:18:16.960 --> 01:18:19.380
Cho Chun, killed by the main families?

01:18:20.260 --> 01:18:23.390
She probably entered Sosnovy Bor to avenge her father.

01:18:24.260 --> 01:18:27.060
Chang Gang's son kept her close, knowing who she was?

01:18:27.140 --> 01:18:28.930
He's dead, we won't know

01:18:29.020 --> 01:18:32.600
But I hope that you will punish Sosnovy Bor for everything

01:18:37.150 --> 01:18:38.690
Where is Nak Soo?

01:18:38.780 --> 01:18:41.280
The magicians of Jeonbugwan are looking for her

01:18:41.360 --> 01:18:45.780
She started to run wild, soon she will turn into stone and die

01:19:03.050 --> 01:19:04.090
Moo Deok

01:19:08.430 --> 01:19:09.810
Moo Deok

01:19:13.850 --> 01:19:14.980
Chan Wook!

01:19:35.080 --> 01:19:39.050
I can't mourn, I can't bury him

01:19:39.630 --> 01:19:41.840
properly, since he is a criminal

01:19:42.590 --> 01:19:45.680
How can he be cremated this way?

01:19:48.140 --> 01:19:49.890
This is not possible!

01:19:50.470 --> 01:19:52.180
Stop them...

01:19:54.060 --> 01:19:55.390
Sosnovy Bor

01:19:56.980 --> 01:19:58.230
has no voice

01:19:59.650 --> 01:20:01.280
in this matter

01:20:03.280 --> 01:20:04.450
I'm sorry

01:20:24.920 --> 01:20:26.130
Mister...

01:21:27.570 --> 01:21:29.910
Why am I here?

01:21:34.410 --> 01:21:35.490
At least...

01:21:39.420 --> 01:21:42.250
I can no longer hear the sound of bells

01:21:47.920 --> 01:21:50.340
Nak Su will go to the grave of the nomads

01:21:51.140 --> 01:21:54.260
There he will meet his death

01:22:10.240 --> 01:22:13.010
Born under the star of the King, you have the power of heaven.

01:22:14.490 --> 01:22:17.620
This is not how you are destined to die,

01:22:18.910 --> 01:22:20.040
Chan Wook

01:22:47.900 --> 01:22:49.070
Mister

01:25:19.700 --> 01:25:33.290
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:25:33.410 --> 01:25:36.370
Alchemy

01:25:33.410 --> 01:25:36.370
Shower
